  "title": "In Istanbul, over there",
  "goal": "Put suffixes on names with an apostrophe, and use onda, bunda, orada and şurada.",
  "points": ["gp-apostrophe", "gp-pronoun-n"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "On names of people, cities and countries, the suffix follows an apostrophe: *İstanbul'da*, *Ayşe'de*. Common nouns take none: *şehirde*. And *bu*, *şu*, *o* add an n before a case ending: *bunda*, *onda*.",
    "see": "gp-apostrophe"
  },
